## 6. Budget Alerts

### Configuração Recomendada

```bash
# Criar alerta para $50/mês
aws budgets create-budget \
  --account-id ACCOUNT_ID \
  --budget file://budget-config.json \
  --notifications-with-subscribers file://notifications.json

# Budget Config
{
  "BudgetName": "portfolio-monthly",
  "BudgetLimit": {
    "Amount": "50.00",
    "Unit": "USD"
  },
  "TimeUnit": "MONTHLY",
  "BudgetType": "COST"
}

# Notificações
[{
  "NotificationType": "FORECASTED",
  "ComparisonOperator": "GREATER_THAN",
  "Threshold": 100
}]
```

### Monitoramento

```bash
# Ver custos reais
aws ce get-cost-and-usage \
  --time-period Start=2024-06-01,End=2024-06-30 \
  --granularity DAILY \
  --metrics BlendedCost

# Usar AWS Cost Explorer (Console)
# https://console.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/
```

